'''Alolan Diglett''' (Japanese: '''アローラディグダ''' ''Alolan Digda'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

